sequenceDiagram
    participant M as Model
    participant K as Kernel
    participant P as Sandbox process
    participant G as Adapter gateway
    participant L as Ledger
    M->>K: one fenced python block
    K->>K: protocol check (exactly one block, else INVALID, no tick)
    K->>P: start fresh process with Build SDK, limits cpu_ms wall_ms memory_mb
    loop each primitive call
        P->>K: RPC primitive(params)
        K->>K: validate params
        K->>K: preconditions in declared order (first failure: code, primitive, index)
        alt read_only or mutating
            K->>K: execute against state
        else external
            K->>G: adapter request
            G-->>K: normalised result or declared failure
        end
        K->>K: assert effects (debug), advance world_time by tick_per_primitive
        K->>L: append record (durable before return)
        K-->>P: result or typed exception
    end
    P-->>K: script end: ok, error or partial with trace
    K->>K: advance world_time by tick_per_turn
    K->>L: append turn record
    K-->>M: context: manual, notice, ledger tail K, result envelope
